# The variables this example reads. Copy to .env, fill in, then load it into your shell
# with `set -a; . ./.env; set +a` — the script reads the environment, not this file.
# .env is excluded by .gitignore — never commit a real connection string; it grants write
# access to ingest under your data source.
#
# Portal -> Data Sources -> <your company> -> <your source> -> Connections
#        -> Primary Connection String
#
# Requires the SourceAdmin role to view. DeviceId is case sensitive.
BDP_DIF_CONNECTION_STRING=
